    "https://www.rochester.edu/human-resources/careers/": {
      "title": "Career Opportunities",
      "description": "Career Opportunities at the University of Rochester | Office of Human Resources Skip to content Apply Visit Give Search Office of Human Resources Search Office of Human Resources MyPath myURHR Menu Career Opportunities Join a world class University We’re looking for talented, skilled, and dedicated professionals to join us as we learn, discover, heal, and create. Explore opportunities Work with Us Career Opportunities Job Catalog Meliora: Our Campus Culture Special Searches Veteran Job Seekers Temporary Positions For New Hires New Employee Orientation Relocating to Rochester Pay & Benefits Total Rewards goes beyond basic benefits Total Rewards is the holistic way we reward our employees. It includes compensation, healthcare plans, tuition benefits, retirement plans, and so much more. Discover Total Rewards Health & Wellness Healthcare Benefits Healthcare Plans & Rates Dental Vision HSA FSA Healthy Living: Well-U Programs & Perks Perks for Working Here Retirement Plans Tuition Benefits Local Discounts Home Ownership Auto, Home & Legal Life Insurance Family Care Retiree Benefits Resources Open Enrollment Changing Benefits Eligibility & Enrollment Forms & Summaries Vacation Time Compensation COVID-19 Impact on Benefits Legal Notices Leave & Disability Professional Success Be a life-long learner Each year, we provide thousands of hours worth of in-person and online learning & professional development programs. This helps our employees and managers keep up with skills, expand their knowledge, and work better together. Learn and grow Learning & Development Your Professional Success Career Development Staff Training New Employee Orientation MyPath Online Learning UR Career Pathways Program Manager’s Toolkit Toolkit Overview Recruiting & Onboarding Managing & Engaging Learning & Developing Transitioning & Offboarding Explore More HR Policies Remote Work Recognition & Awards UR Medicine Employee Assistance Program Leaving University of Rochester Contacts and FAQs How can we help? We’re here to support you in all things related to working at the University of Rochester. If you have a question or need help finding or completing a document, our contact page will point you in the right direction. Get support Reach Out About Human Resources Contact Us Submit Your Question HR Business Partner Contacts University Support Services Frequently Asked Questions FAQs Overview Enrolling In and Changing Benefits Healthcare Leave and Disability Retirement Plans Retirees Well-U Other Programs and Perks Get Help Career Opportunities Benefits Assistance Employment Verification Professional Success Leave and Time Off Assistance COVID-19 Resource Center Resources MyPath myURHR Search Office of Human Resources Search Benefits Retirement plans Health care plans and rates Employee discounts Payroll and compensation Vacation time Helpful links UR Stars Program Human Resources policies Time away from work Job opportunities Contact us Close Search Office of Human Resources Search Benefits Retirement plans Health care plans and rates Employee discounts Payroll and compensation Vacation time Helpful links UR Stars Program Human Resources policies Time away from work Job opportunities Contact us Career Opportunities Behind the scenes of our academic schools, research labs, and patient care facilities, you’ll find a team of 33,000 skilled and talented staff and faculty members with a passion for education, discovery, and high-quality care. Home Career Opportunities Search all staff jobs Find positions available to those outside the University of Rochester. Jobs for current employees If you are a current employee, please log into myURHR Workday to search for and apply to jobs using the Jobs Hub. Featured job opportunities Nursing, RT, APPs (NP and PA) careers Faculty/Physicians Staff and Administration Featured job opportunities Nursing, RT, APPs (NP and PA) careers Faculty Staff and Administration Boundless opportunity Ready to take the next step in your career? Please watch a brief video from University of Rochester President Sarah Mangelsdorf on the culture, opportunities, and experiences awaiting you at the University. Learn more about the University of Rochester See specific opportunities Explore our open positions to see where your skills and abilities match, or look at our updated lists of career opportunities specifically for temporary employees and veterans. Veteran job seekers Find your next challenge. Join us. Temporary positions Offered through the Strong Staffing program. Fuel your potential My move to Rochester was the best professional decision I ever made. The University of Rochester is all about mentorship and collaboration. No matter where you start out, the countless opportunities to build a career and grow here make it an exciting place to be. And knowing we make such a difference to our community is the all-important “why” that brings real purpose and meaning to our work. David Linehan, CEO of the University of Rochester Medical Center (URMC) The University of Rochester is that rare place that combines world-class research with a close-knit community of educators, scholars, and learners. It’s an environment that encourages interdisciplinary collaboration and inspires remarkable innovation. Nicole Sampson, Provost and Chief Academic Officer Employee benefits and perks Pay and benefits We support our employees through Total Rewards, including compensation, healthcare plans, tuition benefits, retirement plans, employee discounts, and more. Culture Our culture thrives on the spirit of Meliora—meaning “ever better”—fostering a vibrant community where faculty and staff from around the world collaborate, innovate, and grow together. Professional growth Our most valuable resource is our people, which is why we offer educational programs and development resources that inspire a talented, driven workforce. Career success tips and resources You belong here. Take a moment to watch a glimpse of our culture, our people, and the meaningful work that connects us and drives us forward, every day. United by purpose, the University of Rochester is a place where your talents are valued, and your impact makes a difference. Skip navigation links Living Our Values: A spotlight on Strong Recovery Community Behavioral Health Clinic Living Our Values: A spotlight on older adult mental health services Living Our Values: A spotlight on guest services Living Our Values: A spotlight on Department of Public Safety officers Living Our Values: A spotlight on phlebotomists Living Our Values: A spotlight on nurse navigators Explore all our spotlights Employment at our affiliated healthcare organizations The University of Rochester is affiliated with several hospitals and other healthcare providers. Explore opportunities by locations: Highland Hospital The Highlands at Pittsford The Highlands at Brighton UR Medicine Home Care Thompson Health Jones Memorial Hospital Noyes Health St. James Hospital Finger Lakes Health Disability accommodations and legal notices EOE, including disability/protected veterans : Requests for disability related accommodations should be directed to (585) 275-4995 . See additional legal notices and federal and state posters regarding employee rights on this page . In support of our values and those of our society, the University of Rochester is committed to not discriminating on the basis of Protected Class(es). This commitment extends to non-discrimination in the administration of our policies, admissions, employment, access, and recruitment of candidates, consistent with our values and based on applicable law . Share opportunities at Rochester Share job openings with your connections. Share To Facebook Share on Facebook X/Twitter Share on X/Twitter LinkedIn Share on LinkedIn Return to the top of the page Explore popular resources Health Care Plans Compensation Tuition Benefits Leave and Disability Employee Discounts UR Stars Program Office of Human Resources See maps and directions Rochester, NY 14627 Search rochester.edu Accessibility Nondiscrimination Feedback Privacy Copyright Emergency Information © University of Rochester 1996-2026"
    },
    "https://www.rochester.edu/human-resources/careers/job-catalog/": {
      "title": "Job Catalog",
      "description": "Job Catalog | Office of Human Resources Skip to content Apply Visit Give Search Office of Human Resources Search Office of Human Resources MyPath myURHR Menu Career Opportunities Join a world class University We’re looking for talented, skilled, and dedicated professionals to join us as we learn, discover, heal, and create. Explore opportunities Work with Us Career Opportunities Job Catalog Meliora: Our Campus Culture Special Searches Veteran Job Seekers Temporary Positions For New Hires New Employee Orientation Relocating to Rochester Pay & Benefits Total Rewards goes beyond basic benefits Total Rewards is the holistic way we reward our employees. It includes compensation, healthcare plans, tuition benefits, retirement plans, and so much more. Discover Total Rewards Health & Wellness Healthcare Benefits Healthcare Plans & Rates Dental Vision HSA FSA Healthy Living: Well-U Programs & Perks Perks for Working Here Retirement Plans Tuition Benefits Local Discounts Home Ownership Auto, Home & Legal Life Insurance Family Care Retiree Benefits Resources Open Enrollment Changing Benefits Eligibility & Enrollment Forms & Summaries Vacation Time Compensation COVID-19 Impact on Benefits Legal Notices Leave & Disability Professional Success Be a life-long learner Each year, we provide thousands of hours worth of in-person and online learning & professional development programs. This helps our employees and managers keep up with skills, expand their knowledge, and work better together. Learn and grow Learning & Development Your Professional Success Career Development Staff Training New Employee Orientation MyPath Online Learning UR Career Pathways Program Manager’s Toolkit Toolkit Overview Recruiting & Onboarding Managing & Engaging Learning & Developing Transitioning & Offboarding Explore More HR Policies Remote Work Recognition & Awards UR Medicine Employee Assistance Program Leaving University of Rochester Contacts and FAQs How can we help? We’re here to support you in all things related to working at the University of Rochester. If you have a question or need help finding or completing a document, our contact page will point you in the right direction. Get support Reach Out About Human Resources Contact Us Submit Your Question HR Business Partner Contacts University Support Services Frequently Asked Questions FAQs Overview Enrolling In and Changing Benefits Healthcare Leave and Disability Retirement Plans Retirees Well-U Other Programs and Perks Get Help Career Opportunities Benefits Assistance Employment Verification Professional Success Leave and Time Off Assistance COVID-19 Resource Center Resources MyPath myURHR Search Office of Human Resources Search Benefits Retirement plans Health care plans and rates Employee discounts Payroll and compensation Vacation time Helpful links UR Stars Program Human Resources policies Time away from work Job opportunities Contact us Close Search Office of Human Resources Search Benefits Retirement plans Health care plans and rates Employee discounts Payroll and compensation Vacation time Helpful links UR Stars Program Human Resources policies Time away from work Job opportunities Contact us Job Catalog Home Career Opportunities Job Catalog The University of Rochester’s Job Catalog is your one-stop-shop for gaining line of sight to opportunities and career paths, understanding where your role fits within our organization, learning about the University’s many roles, exploring career paths of interest, and identifying skill growth and development opportunities. Use the interactive Job Catalog to see details for every job, including: Job Title Job Code Career Stream Job Family Group and Job Family Job Level Pay Range General Purpose (job summary) Knowledge and Experience Essential Duties Visit the Job Catalog today to understand where your current job fits within the University of Rochester. Resources Job Catalog Training Complete the Exploring Career Paths with the Job Catalog training in MyPath to learn how to navigate the Job Catalog to discover jobs that align with your career goals. Career Navigation: MyCareer Plan Complete self-assessments to align your skills with your interests and find your career pathway. Navigation quick guide Step 1: Narrow your search criteria – Career Streams + Job Levels From the Job Catalog homepage, you can click on one or more job levels and/or career streams to narrow your search results. Selecting a career stream button will include all jobs within that career stream in your search results. Once you have selected the job level(s) and career stream(s) you’re interested in, click on the Job Catalog button in the upper left corner. Step 2: Narrow your search criteria – Job Family Groups and Job Families and/or keyword search You can narrow your search results further on the Job Catalog page. (A) Filter Job Family Select Job Family Group(s) from the drop-down on the left. Click outside of the drop-down menu to see your results. Repeat using the Job Families drop-down on the right to further filter your results. AND/OR (B) Search for a keyword Enter a keyword or job title in the search bar at the top of the page. Results will update to jobs including that keyword/title. Step 3: Review job profiles (C) Select a job profile by clicking on the job title in the results table. (D) The job profile appears on the right side of your screen. The general purpose and knowledge and experience situations are an enhancement coming on March 18, 2024. Return to the top of the page Explore popular resources Health Care Plans Compensation Tuition Benefits Leave and Disability Employee Discounts UR Stars Program Office of Human Resources See maps and directions Rochester, NY 14627 Search rochester.edu Accessibility Nondiscrimination Feedback Privacy Copyright Emergency Information © University of Rochester 1996-2026"
    },
    "https://www.rochester.edu/human-resources/careers/meliora/": {
      "title": "Meliora: What it Means to Be ‘Ever Better’",
      "description": "Meliora & Our Campus Culture | University of Rochester Human Resources Skip to content Apply Visit Give Search Office of Human Resources Search Office of Human Resources MyPath myURHR Menu Career Opportunities Join a world class University We’re looking for talented, skilled, and dedicated professionals to join us as we learn, discover, heal, and create. Explore opportunities Work with Us Career Opportunities Job Catalog Meliora: Our Campus Culture Special Searches Veteran Job Seekers Temporary Positions For New Hires New Employee Orientation Relocating to Rochester Pay & Benefits Total Rewards goes beyond basic benefits Total Rewards is the holistic way we reward our employees. It includes compensation, healthcare plans, tuition benefits, retirement plans, and so much more. Discover Total Rewards Health & Wellness Healthcare Benefits Healthcare Plans & Rates Dental Vision HSA FSA Healthy Living: Well-U Programs & Perks Perks for Working Here Retirement Plans Tuition Benefits Local Discounts Home Ownership Auto, Home & Legal Life Insurance Family Care Retiree Benefits Resources Open Enrollment Changing Benefits Eligibility & Enrollment Forms & Summaries Vacation Time Compensation COVID-19 Impact on Benefits Legal Notices Leave & Disability Professional Success Be a life-long learner Each year, we provide thousands of hours worth of in-person and online learning & professional development programs. This helps our employees and managers keep up with skills, expand their knowledge, and work better together. Learn and grow Learning & Development Your Professional Success Career Development Staff Training New Employee Orientation MyPath Online Learning UR Career Pathways Program Manager’s Toolkit Toolkit Overview Recruiting & Onboarding Managing & Engaging Learning & Developing Transitioning & Offboarding Explore More HR Policies Remote Work Recognition & Awards UR Medicine Employee Assistance Program Leaving University of Rochester Contacts and FAQs How can we help? We’re here to support you in all things related to working at the University of Rochester. If you have a question or need help finding or completing a document, our contact page will point you in the right direction. Get support Reach Out About Human Resources Contact Us Submit Your Question HR Business Partner Contacts University Support Services Frequently Asked Questions FAQs Overview Enrolling In and Changing Benefits Healthcare Leave and Disability Retirement Plans Retirees Well-U Other Programs and Perks Get Help Career Opportunities Benefits Assistance Employment Verification Professional Success Leave and Time Off Assistance COVID-19 Resource Center Resources MyPath myURHR Search Office of Human Resources Search Benefits Retirement plans Health care plans and rates Employee discounts Payroll and compensation Vacation time Helpful links UR Stars Program Human Resources policies Time away from work Job opportunities Contact us Close Search Office of Human Resources Search Benefits Retirement plans Health care plans and rates Employee discounts Payroll and compensation Vacation time Helpful links UR Stars Program Human Resources policies Time away from work Job opportunities Contact us Meliora: What it Means to Be ‘Ever Better’ Guided by the University of Rochester’s motto, the Office of Human Resources supports a culture of engagement and respect where all employees can maximize their potential. Home Career Opportunities Meliora & Our Campus Culture Learn. Discover. Heal. Create… and make the world ever better These words guide everything we do at the University of Rochester. Our welcoming and supportive community is made up of thousands of students, staff and faculty members, clinicians, and other professionals who contribute to and benefit from our teaching, research, patient care, and community service. Our experienced human resources team—150+ strong—is proud to support, develop, and recognize employees across the organization as they dedicate their careers to the University’s mission. Human Resources: Living our values Our mission and vision The HR organization promotes a culture of engagement, where all people can maximize their potential and contribute to the spirit of Meliora. Learn more about HR Attracting and rewarding talent We work with our management teams to build strong candidate pools, and we invest in our employees and their families through a generous compensation and benefits package. Learn about our benefits Professional success With plentiful online and in-person training and development opportunities, University employees can continually improve in their work. Explore options Employee recognition: The Meliora award Each year we honor a select number of staff members and teams whose work exemplifies the University’s motto. This is just one of many ways we honor our employees. Learn more Return to the top of the page Explore popular resources Health Care Plans Compensation Tuition Benefits Leave and Disability Employee Discounts UR Stars Program Office of Human Resources See maps and directions Rochester, NY 14627 Search rochester.edu Accessibility Nondiscrimination Feedback Privacy Copyright Emergency Information © University of Rochester 1996-2026"
    },
    "http://universityofrochester-veterans.jobs/": {
      "title": "Career Opportunities for Veterans",
      "description": "University of Rochester - Jobs Skip To Main Content Office of Human Resources Career Opportunities Total Rewards: Benefits & Pay Professional Success Working at Rochester Contacts and FAQs MyPath HRMS Career Opportunities for Veterans It is our honor. The University of Rochester is proud to support veterans of the United States military. We honor your service to our nation Not only did you serve and protect, but through your military experience you gained a wealth of skills that will help you transition to your next career. The teamwork and leadership you practiced in the military are foundational to your successes here as well. What Where Military Find Jobs View all jobs Browse Jobs by Military Base Veteran Resources Empowering our veterans We would like to help you align your skills and aspirations with a rich variety of career opportunities available at the University of Rochester. We offer unique resources to veterans, including: Employment counseling to help veterans like you successfully shift from military to civilian careers. Weâll help guide you through the application and hiring processes, while answering your questions and providing advice along the way. An online career tool to help translate your military experience to relevant positions at the University of Rochester. The Veterans Alliance , a community of veterans and family members across the University dedicated to fostering an environment of advocacy and support as you adjust to post-military life. The Veterans Career Education page provides a wealth of resources specifically designed to support the Universityâs military veteran students. On this page, you can find career guidance, job search tools, networking opportunities, and valuable information about veteran-friendly employers. It serves as a crucial support hub, equipping you with the necessary tools and guidance to successfully transition into a civilian career. We value the opportunity to support you, and look forward working with you to explore your future at the University of Rochester! Kathy Gallucci Chief Human Resources Officer Testimonials Peter G. Robinson, Vice President & COO, Medical Center & Strong Health, Colonel My military experience has been foundational to my career at the University of Rochester and the Medical Center. From my initial assignment as a motor vehicle operator to my last position as a corps support group commander, I have benefited from the armyâs educational programs and a breadth of assignments that have prepared me to be an effective team member and a leader. In the military we are mission focused and learn to perform at the highest level. We are fortunate at the University that we have a mission that we can support and believe in every bit as much as we do in the armed forces. There is no better preparation for a career at the University than a successful military experience. As veterans we are well positioned to make valuable contributions to the future success of the University of Rochester. Share this job opportunity SHARE TO See maps and directions Rochester, NY 14627 Accessibility Nondiscrimination Copyright Emergency Information Vision & Values Â© University of Rochester 1996-2026"
    },
