Qs How can we help? We’re here to support you in all things related to working at the University of Rochester. If you have a question or need help finding or completing a document, our contact page will point you in the right direction. Get support Reach Out About Human Resources Contact Us Submit Your Question HR Business Partner Contacts University Support Services Frequently Asked Questions FAQs Overview Enrolling In and Changing Benefits Healthcare Leave and Disability Retirement Plans Retirees Well-U Other Programs and Perks Get Help Career Opportunities Benefits Assistance Employment Verification Professional Success Leave and Time Off Assistance COVID-19 Resource Center Resources MyPath myURHR Search Office of Human Resources Search Benefits Retirement plans Health care plans and rates Employee discounts Payroll and compensation Vacation time Helpful links UR Stars Program Human Resources policies Time away from work Job opportunities Contact us Close Search Office of Human Resources Search Benefits Retirement plans Health care plans and rates Employee discounts Payroll and compensation Vacation time Helpful links UR Stars Program Human Resources policies Time away from work Job opportunities Contact us Career Opportunities Contacts Home Contact Human Resources Get Help Career Opportunities Contacts Explore More Career Opportunities Benefits Assistance Health Care Programs and Perks Retirement Support Retiree Support Well-U Employment Verification Leave and Time Off Assistance Professional Success Contacts HR Business Partner Contacts Explore More Career Opportunities Benefits Assistance Health Care Programs and Perks Retirement Support Retiree Support Well-U Employment Verification Leave and Time Off Assistance Professional Success Contacts HR Business Partner Contacts Visit the Careers page for an overview of the career opportunities available at the University of Rochester. Contact information for specific careers-related support services is listed below. 